{"posts":[{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_201","t":"","a":"Red Knight","d":"","n":"#201","p":9,"im":["ab2e52ec447212cbe0bf530d77a8bd6c987868a2"],"m":201},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_202","t":"Red Knight\n\nIfmyante wrote: That's a great study, RK\n\nI hope others try it this way too\n\nBest\n\nIf\n\nThank you and I would like to say thank you to everyone who posted here.Big thanks guys for your HW'S presentations, some useful web.links etc. all that is big help for me.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#202","p":9,"im":[],"m":202},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_203","t":"4-200 Result: 23 zones 11 zones=respected 9 zones =ignored 1 zone=0.5 2 zones not tested 1 zone testing right now\n\n7 S/R zones 6 zones =respected 1 zone=0.5","a":"Red Knight","d":"","n":"#203","p":9,"im":["406fdda80158a857ff8c56b6de325b6d346fa080"],"m":203},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_204","t":"5-200\n\nResult: 22-RDB/DBR zones 4-zones=not tested 9-zones=respected 7-zones =ignored 2-zones=0.5\n\n7-S/R zones\n\n6-zones=respected 1-zone=ignored","a":"Red Knight","d":"","n":"#204","p":9,"im":["e5f2dfbff4df98b6a71c85ef4382ab3b05cf81c0"],"m":204},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_205","t":"6-200\n\nResult: 22 RDB/DBR zones 1-zones=not tested 15-zones=respected 6-zones=ignored\n\n9-S/R zones 8-zones=respected 1-zone=ignored","a":"Red Knight","d":"","n":"#205","p":9,"im":["c39364928fdafc2d6e057d4ec5586939acc0e3f0"],"m":205},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_206","t":"7-200\n\nResult: 31-RDB/DBR zones 15-zones=respected 8-zones=ignored 6-zones=0.5 2-zones=not tested\n\n15-S/R zones 12-zones=respected 3-zones=ignored","a":"Red Knight","d":"","n":"#206","p":9,"im":["0f3fea1d070b024deb7cd6963d722b7cb5eb4813","664297e8f73c8b5a9bf77d1983c0dc7ddcbdd342"],"m":206},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_207","t":"8-200 Result: 20-RDB/DBR zones 18-zones=respected 1-zone=ignored 1-zone=0.5 1-zone=not tested\n\n7-S/R zones 4-zones=respected 1-zone=ignored 2-zones=not tested.","a":"Red Knight","d":"","n":"#207","p":9,"im":["47ef3d2de4490c151cba7a80fe136c2bcb0fef28"],"m":207},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_208","t":"Here's a few clear examples of DBR & RBDs with Reactions. A lot more to come. Comments are welcome.","a":"AlexC","d":"","n":"#208","p":9,"im":["9dccbafb0a06ead4afd023417725de6ad337466a"],"m":208},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_209","t":"Hi Alex,\n\nNice chart, I can see that you understand the concept of DBR RBD very well. About the cp, there is other cp going on on your chart.... Can you spot it?\n\nBest, Mel","a":"@mel","d":"","n":"#209","p":9,"im":[],"m":209},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_210","t":"Result: 40-zones RBD/DBR 26-zones=respected 6-zones=ignored 2-zones=0.5 3-zones= not tested (hm counting doesn't look right but don't want to check again)\n\n15-S/R zones 12-zones=respected 3-zones=ignored\n\n9-200:\n\n10-200:\n\n11-200:","a":"Red Knight","d":"","n":"#210","p":9,"im":["584362e9ab4061979a7599f2f0c9bb54002855d7","528eee4dcbae9cc32e51ec4d71eca17fa3c0c94c","584d09b6e20d4ece43f763a2c8ef96ee7c285faa"],"m":210},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_211","t":"Hi Mel, I see cps when price rallies and drops to the bases on this chart. Thank you Mel for pointing them out.:)>-","a":"AlexC","d":"","n":"#211","p":9,"im":["605296ea50d9e8aad312afdac2c705c9dfc2a71c"],"m":211},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_212","t":"Here some more examples of DBR/RBD with CP shown on a 5m chart.","a":"AlexC","d":"","n":"#212","p":9,"im":["723505031ab93fee095a97e7b9849a9a9f40680a"],"m":212},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_213","t":"Examples of DBR/RBD with CP shown on the USD/CAD daily chart.","a":"AlexC","d":"","n":"#213","p":9,"im":["b02275a35b6b5fae5e66d73d4a80fd579dc20dc4"],"m":213},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_214","t":"Careful how you draw your cp","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#214","p":9,"im":["8d2331e0404f86691d28612686fb8a0b7898e6ed","0a7a5726a6658473a9904fff61cbd83215ed7499"],"m":214},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_215","t":"a lot of ppl draw Consumtion as Compression. i guess there has been a mix up somewhere, in areas like a wedge where you dont know where price will go next its ok but the rest...?","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#215","p":9,"im":[],"m":215},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_216","t":"Result:\n\n53-RDB/DBR zones 36-zones=respected 12-zones=ignored 3-zones=0.5\n\n2-zones=not touched 1-zone=not count\n\n15-S/R zones 8-zones=respected 5-zones ignored 2-zones=0.5\n\n12-200:\n\n13-200:\n\n14-200:","a":"Red Knight","d":"","n":"#216","p":9,"im":["364f6a65a381ec9e0d8391ca333bee4b9bc3cdea","66fa2084c73f0b7ea539ebaac363c26d14e6e515","9b698d53d44ae5835264a8d343af45f3876fda16"],"m":216},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_217","t":"Hi Ifmyante, The cp turning points I understand now from what you noted on my cp homework. I noticed now how you drew the lines on the bottom for rising cps and from above on dropping cps. Good to know. I see how cps can look unruly from the opposite sides. Thanks again If, much appreciated.","a":"AlexC","d":"","n":"#217","p":9,"im":[],"m":217},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_218","t":"Result: 42-RBD/DBR 24-zones=respected 9-zones=ignored 3-zones=0.5 5- zones=not touched\n\n13-S/R zones 11-zones=respected 1-zone=ignored 1-zone=not tested\n\n15-200:\n\n16-200:\n\n17-200:","a":"Red Knight","d":"","n":"#218","p":9,"im":["f1b51b47c3f59c80e8be352d6a7c4773d265d175","b32ee31e3c6b5852607803fe5a4ad77d5edf7d13","2882549ec19e8e1391cd0e46111063dd070ad41f"],"m":218},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_219","t":"AlexC wrote: Hi Ifmyante, The cp turning points I understand now from what you noted on my cp homework. I noticed now how you drew the lines on the bottom for rising cps and from above on dropping cps. Good to know. I see how cps can look unruly from the opposite sides. Thanks again If, much appreciated.\n\nAlex, exatly as you said. you draw CP from the side that price will visit (if it does) to indicate it will have an easy pass through as the orders that were sitting there have been removed.","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#219","p":9,"im":[],"m":219},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_220","t":"Thanks Harry.","a":"AlexC","d":"","n":"#220","p":9,"im":[],"m":220},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_221","t":"Here's a 5m chart","a":"AlexC","d":"","n":"#221","p":9,"im":["c7b24fc1de92a51f1217f609bc2834c24500afda"],"m":221},{"id":"dbrrbd_p9_222","t":"Result:\n\n71-R